    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83618" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλᾰτυ-χαίτας</span></b> , corrupt in <i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			2.292d
		</span></i>, who says it is 
			Boeot.
		 for <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>neighbour</i>:
			Schneid., comparing <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμωχέτας,</span>
			restored <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλᾱτ-ωχέτας</span></b> 
			(better <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλᾱτι-ωχέτας</span></b> , from
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλατίον,</span>
			
				Dor.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλησίον</span>).</div>
